Brou for iPhone and iPad
========================

Brou is maintained by Victor Correal and has its own product name and icon.
The original Search attribution and license are retained below.

Part of the JavaScript in this app comes from Search, a WebKit browser
for macOS by Office Commun (https://github.com/driceroland/Search), released
under the MIT License. It was taken from Victor Correal's own build of Search
(private repository victorcorreal/search, commit 7689f1f, 10 October 2026):

  Shared (Extension)/Resources/dark.js       from Sources/Search/DarkPages.swift (DarkPages.script)
  Shared (Extension)/Resources/reader.js     from Sources/Search/Reader.swift (Reader.script)
  Shared (Extension)/Resources/text-only.js  from Sources/Search/ReaderText.swift (Reader.textOnlyScript)
  Tests/pages.py                             test pages from Tests/dark_pages.py

The code is unchanged apart from the identifiers it leaves on a page
(element ids, a data attribute and a window property), renamed so that they
carry no other product's name.

